<title>JAPAN: Kanto Special Steel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kanto Special Steel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.35		vs	    7.37</p>
<p> Operating   loss 199    mln	  vs   loss 501    mln</p>
<p> Current     loss 275    mln	  vs   loss 539    mln</p>
<p> Net	   loss 287    mln	  vs   loss 599    mln</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 5.04 yen	  vs    loss 11.36 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     57 million	  vs	  53 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kanto Special Steel Works Ltd makes forged-steel rolls and is affiliated with Sumitomo Metal Industries Ltd.</p>
